## Key Concepts
- **Online convolutive ICA**: Adapting demixers in streaming fashion with minimal latency
- **Source‑count estimation**: Handling drift between 1–3 simultaneous speakers
- **Cross‑bin permutation alignment**: Ensuring consistent demixing across frequency bins despite per‑bin ICA ambiguity
- **Microphone dropout resilience**: Maintaining performance when sensors fail intermittently
